en_Nombre=Small dragons
en_Desc=You have managed to defeat those Hyenas and Beholders without any problem, I congratulate you! Those little dragons can grant you, if you're lucky, a great spell; Complete this mission and see me again.
en_DescFinal=Have you managed to get the spell? No problem, you can get it for a few gold coins, south of here, in the city of Arkhein.
