en_Nombre=The Howl in the Gloom
en_Desc=Wild Wolves prowl our lands under the shadow of a sick moon. The weapons master summons you: you must not only hunt them, but also pluck from one of them its Cursed Fang. Only a wolf, touched by darkness, bears it. Seek, wait
en_DescFinal=You've done it! That tusk isn't obtained without courage. Take it to Bertrand, the famous Blacksmith of Nix; he may have a weapon for you.
pt_Nombre=Crusher de Aranha
pt_Desc=Você deve parar o ataque da rainha da arenida! Se você conseguir vencer um de seus protetores, o Arachnid Crusher, estará na história desta cidade!
fr_Nombre=Concasseur
fr_Desc=Vous devez arrêter l'attaque de l'Arennida Queen! Si vous parvenez à battre l'un de ses protecteurs, le concasseur arachnide, vous serez dans l'histoire de cette ville!
it_Nombre=Arenide Crusher
it_Desc=Devi fermare l'attacco della regina di Arenida! Se riesci a battere uno dei suoi protettori, The Aracnid Crusher, sarai nella storia di questa città!
NoWiki=1
 and listen for the distinct howl. The Wolf Fang is not earned by luck, but by determination.

