en_Nombre=Arachnid Queen
en_Desc=The last effort to defend this city... If you manage to defeat Ghulvara, the Spider Queen, you will be worthy of this recognition!
en_DescFinal=You've done it, this story is finally over... the peace of Ullathorpe City is restored, and you will go down in the history of this game... Have this Spider Mutant Reins as recognition of your bravery!
